### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### List all todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos

### Get a specific todo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### Create a new todo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Glib framework"
}

### Create another todo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build REST API"
}

### Update a todo
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Master Glib framework",
  "completed": true
}

### Update only completion status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### Delete a todo
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### Validation Error Example - Title too short
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hi"
}

### Validation Error Example - Missing title
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Not Found Error Example
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/999
